     "<div dir=\"ltr\">各位大大我想要抓這個網站<a href=\"https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238011674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12gXXDSTKeIwCAQ4jH6xkO\">https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php</a>的output我的input設定如下<p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ta9EDEcc02w/VzlR9gogiII/AAAAAAAAAA0/jQrvy1nWEzkhjzvOEPtXPLVsFlCqj8eRQCLcB/s1600/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587%2B3.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ta9EDEcc02w/VzlR9gogiII/AAAAAAAAAA0/jQrvy1nWEzkhjzvOEPtXPLVsFlCqj8eRQCLcB/s1600/%2525E5%25259C%252596%2525E7%252589%252587%252B3.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238011674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HJZmjOpcpfTrGJyLBiy9-\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ta9EDEcc02w/VzlR9gogiII/AAAAAAAAAA0/jQrvy1nWEzkhjzvOEPtXPLVsFlCqj8eRQCLcB/s320/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587%2B3.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>我的程式碼</div><div><div>library(httr);</div><div>library(XML);</div><div>library(RCurl)<br></div><div>library(rvest)</div></div><div><br></div><div><div>search=html_form(html(&quot;<a href=\"https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238011674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12gXXDSTKeIwCAQ4jH6xkO\">https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php</a>&quot;))[[1]]</div><div>      </div><div>      search=set_values(search, NULL=&quot;1&quot;)</div><div>      search=set_values(search,  hapMapRelease=&quot;hapmap3r2&quot;)</div><div>      search=set_values(search,  hapMapPanel=&quot;CEU&quot;)</div><div>      search=set_values(search,   RSquaredLimit=&quot;0&quot;)</div><div>      search=set_values(search,  distanceLimit=&quot;500000&quot;)</div><div>      search=set_values(search, downloadType=&quot;Browser&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>      for(j in 18:42){</div><div>      search$fields[[i]]$checked=&quot;checked&quot;</div><div>}</div><div>     </div><div>     search=set_values(search,  snpList=&quot;rs9300522<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>rs16955981&quot;)</div><div> A=submit_form(html_session(&quot;<a href=\"https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238011674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12gXXDSTKeIwCAQ4jH6xkO\">https://www.broadinstitute.org/mpg/snap/ldsearchpw.php</a>&quot;), search)</div><div>req = content(A$response,&#39;text&#39;, encoding = &#39;utf8&#39;)</div><div>req1 = htmlParse(req, encoding = &#39;UTF-8&#39;)</div></div><div><br></div><div><div>Warning message:</div><div>XML content does not seem to be XML: &#39;SNP<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Proxy<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Distance<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>RSquared<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>DPrime</div><div>rs9300522<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>WARNING<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>No matching proxy snps found</div><div>rs16955981<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>WARNING<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>No matching proxy snps found</div></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KFQL5Hhd8HQ/VzlSt7ihJDI/AAAAAAAAAA8/3DkkYir_wqgtsiEmn8WWH0aFh-Mx31U0wCLcB/s1600/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587%2B4.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KFQL5Hhd8HQ/VzlSt7ihJDI/AAAAAAAAAA8/3DkkYir_wqgtsiEmn8WWH0aFh-Mx31U0wCLcB/s1600/%2525E5%25259C%252596%2525E7%252589%252587%252B4.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238011674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ti_MeSUtkwK5TfIQdQcNa\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-KFQL5Hhd8HQ/VzlSt7ihJDI/AAAAAAAAAA8/3DkkYir_wqgtsiEmn8WWH0aFh-Mx31U0wCLcB/s320/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%2587%2B4.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\">我的output跟我想要的結果是不一樣的!!請問各位大大我該如何更改我的程式碼??我個人認為是selection的設定沒有改變</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div></div>"
